PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/members/me/setting
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "transit_type": "ALL",
  "preparation_time": 10
}

### E-17-1. preparationTime 누락 → 400 "여유시간 필수"
